          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Also note that by construction,  $ |x - r_i| \\geq \\varepsilon $ for each  $ x \\in I $. If  $ |r_i| \\leq 1 $, then we have  $ \\frac{|x - r_i|}{|r_i|} \\geq \\varepsilon $. If  $ |r_i| > 1 $, then",
