          "block_label": "display_formula",
          "block_content": " $$ \\frac{\\left|x-r_{i}\\right|}{\\left|r_{i}\\right|}=\\left|1-x/r_{i}\\right|\\geq1-\\left|x/r_{i}\\right|\\geq=1/2>\\varepsilon. $$ ",
